<form class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 space-y-3" data-testid="season-break">
<h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Season break</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 max-w-2xl">Tick the months your club plays no games. For those months no list opens, no games are made and nothing is posted. The month after starts as usual, with the regulars of the last month played.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2026-11" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>November 2026</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2026-12" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>December 2026</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2027-01" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>January 2027</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2027-02" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>February 2027</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2027-03" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>March 2027</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2027-04" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>April 2027</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2027-05" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>May 2027</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
<input type="checkbox" data-testid="season-break-month" data-month="2027-06" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300"/>June 2027</label>
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
