<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">5 games: 2, 9, 16, 23, 30</p>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-800" data-testid="month-state" data-outcome="none">You are not on this month&#x27;s list yet.</p>
<div class="space-y-2" data-testid="month-join-rest">
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">The month is under way. You can still join for the rest of it: 4 games.</p>
<button type="button" class="h-10 rounded-lg px-3 text-sm font-medium disabled:opacity-40 bg-slate-900 text-white" data-testid="month-join-rest-btn">Join for the rest of the month</button>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</div>
</div>",
