<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Next month: December 2026</h3>
<section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm" data-testid="next-month-card" data-activity="a-vets">
<div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
<div>
<h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800">December 2026: Monday Night Football</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Games this month: 4. Already played: 0.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-6 space-y-4" data-testid="next-month-empty">
<div>
<h4 class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Start December 2026 from your list</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-2xl">Paste the list your group is using for December 2026. MatchTime matches the names to your players for you to check, then starts the month with them. It does not post its own list straight after: it posts the list only when someone changes it.</p>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1" data-testid="next-month-held">MatchTime is not posting a list for December 2026 until you start it here.</p>
</div>
<form class="space-y-4" data-testid="next-start-month-form">
<div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 space-y-2" data-testid="next-start-paste">
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">
<label for="paste-a-vets">Paste your current list</label>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Copy this month&#x27;s list from your group and paste it here. MatchTime ticks the players for you, with their paid marks and PAYG. Nothing is saved until you start the month.</p>
<textarea id="paste-a-vets" data-testid="next-start-paste-text" rows="5" class="w-full max-w-xl px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white text-sm text-slate-700 font-mono">
</textarea>
<div>
<button type="button" data-testid="next-start-paste-read" disabled="" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 disabled:opacity-50">Read the list</button>
