</div>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Starting the month this way posts nothing straight away. MatchTime posts the list when someone changes it. MatchTime posts the list in your group and players sign up there.</p>
</form>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<form class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 space-y-3" data-testid="season-break">
